{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26531","headline":"送裴大夫赴亳州 · 姚合","name":"送裴大夫赴亳州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杭人遮道路，垂泣浙江前。\n谯国迎舟舰，行歌汴水边。\n周旋君量远，交代我才偏。\n寒日严旌戟，晴风出管弦。\n一桮诚淡薄，四坐愿留连。\n异政承殊泽，应爲天下先。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26531.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26531","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}